      "offset by strong premium growth driven by increased rates over the past 12 months",
      "loss activity during 2020 and 2021 had a continued positive effect on the rating environment",
      "syndicate experienced a large net release on the MAP Risks and Property Risks divisions, offset by a strengthening on the Cyber Risks division on the 2020 underwriting year"
